[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 16090.63, "timestamp": "04:28:10", "text": "糟糕。便宜沒好貨。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16093.469, "timestamp": "04:28:13", "text": "嗯？伊瑪先生，那東西便宜嗎？我可以要嗎？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16096.145, "timestamp": "04:28:16", "text": "我之前在那個特殊功能上花了太多錢。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16096.95, "timestamp": "04:28:16", "text": "[笑聲]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16103.269, "timestamp": "04:28:23", "text": "哦，這要花錢，對吧？哦"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16103.75, "timestamp": "04:28:23", "text": "聖莫 100"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16106.03, "timestamp": "04:28:26", "text": "一萬日圓意味著這筆交易可能不是一次性完成的，對吧？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16119.349, "timestamp": "04:28:39", "text": "是的。我覺得全力以赴也沒什麼不好。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16121.83, "timestamp": "04:28:41", "text": "我剛剛解鎖了AK。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16124.31, "timestamp": "04:28:44", "text": "那是很久以前的事了。這是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16129.79, "timestamp": "04:28:49", "text": "正確的？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16131.389, "timestamp": "04:28:51", "text": "你知道，AK威力很大。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16132.59, "timestamp": "04:28:52", "text": "AK威力非常大。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16134.269, "timestamp": "04:28:54", "text": "我立刻就盯上它了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16137.389, "timestamp": "04:28:57", "text": "我也會直接選AK。"}]